// SUPERSEDED (Wave 5, ADR-18).
//
// The Wave-0 tracer used a single UDL function `decode_touch`. The full core
// surface is now exported with **proc-macro UniFFI** directly on
// `featherkey-core` (see android/ffi-bridge/rust-overlay/ffi.rs and APPLY.md),
// not via a UDL. There is no `.udl` to compile: `uniffi::setup_scaffolding!()`
// plus `#[derive(uniffi::Object/Record/Error)]` generate the bindings.
//
// This file is retained only as a historical marker; it is not referenced by
// any build script. Delete it once the proc-macro export is merged and building.
